PROVENANCE

The logos were generated with an AI image tool under the owner's direction, then
chosen and approved by the owner. The owner supplied them on 2026-10-08 (#397). The
files are kept byte for byte as supplied, and tests/test_brand_assets.py checks
each one against the digest above.

gnostoa-logo-on-light.png is derived from gnostoa-logo.png: the same image,
unchanged, on a white tile with rounded corners, for dark backgrounds. The owner
chose it on 2026-10-08 (#399). The terms above apply to it as to the others. Decision 0111 records their location, terms
and provenance.
